msgid ""
"In the next window, specify the path to the Godot binary that includes debug "
"symbols."
msgstr ""
"Sa chéad fhuinneog eile, sonraigh an cosán chuig an dénártha Godot lena n-"
"áirítear siombailí dífhabhtaithe."

msgid ""
"Specify command line arguments to run a specific project, with or without "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"Sonraigh argóintí líne na n-orduithe chun tionscadal ar leith a reáchtáil, "
"leis an eagarthóir nó gan é."

msgid ""
"Click **Start Recording** and perform the actions you wish to profile in the "
"editor/project."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil **Tosaigh Taifeadadh** agus déan na gníomhartha is mian leat a "
"phróifíliú san eagarthóir/tionscadal."

msgid ""
"Click **View Results** and wait for the profiling visualization to be "
"generated:"
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil **Féach ar Thorthaí** agus fan go nginfear an léirshamhlú "
"próifílithe:"

msgid ""
"Use the tabs at the top to navigate between the different views. These views "
"show the same data, but in different ways. The **Flame Graph** tab is a good "
"way to see which functions take up the most time at a glance. These "
"functions are therefore the most important ones to optimize, since "
"optimizing them will improve performance the most."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as na cluaisíní ag an mbarr chun nascleanúint a dhéanamh idir na "
"tuairimí éagsúla. Léiríonn na tuairimí seo na sonraí céanna, ach ar bhealaí "
"éagsúla. Is bealach maith é an cluaisín **Flame Graph ** chun a fheiceáil cé "
"na feidhmeanna a ghlacann an t-am is mó sracfhéachaint. Dá bhrí sin, is iad "
"na feidhmeanna seo na cinn is tábhachtaí chun an leas is fearr a bhaint "
"astu, ós rud é go bhfeabhsóidh siad feidhmíocht an chuid is mó."

msgid ""
"This process attachment-based workflow is similar to the one used by "
"VerySleepy."
msgstr ""
"Tá an sreabhadh oibre bunaithe ar cheangal próisis seo cosúil leis an gceann "
"a úsáideann VerySleepy."
